      "widgets_values": [
        "N-39 Auto Align — line up a second shot with a reference.\n\nA crop + rescale of the portrait stands in for a second exposure. Auto Align matches SIFT features (no download; method = loftr downloads ~45 MB on first use), fits a RANSAC homography and warps the image into the reference frame. valid_mask marks the covered area; N-44 QA Image Diff measures the residual inside it."
